6
00:00:35,808 --> 00:00:42,030
[SPEAKER_01]: A man with good eyesight, standing on the bank, would not see his own facial reflection as it really is.

7
00:00:42,991 --> 00:00:53,775
[SPEAKER_01]: So, too, when a monk dwells with a mind overcome by sloth and torpor, he does not understand what is for his own welfare, for the welfare of others, or for the welfare of both.

8
00:00:55,896 --> 00:00:56,376
[SPEAKER_01]: So, it's a

9
