[SPEAKER_01]: Your sensuality, though that's used as a relaxation technique, you don't feel rested and light after it, burden-free, you know.

119
00:10:38,066 --> 00:10:39,007
[SPEAKER_01]: The weight has been lifted.

120
00:10:39,047 --> 00:10:40,167
[SPEAKER_01]: No, it's even worse.

121
00:10:41,493 --> 00:10:43,421
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, definitely.

